{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23438","headline":"荅微之夸越州州宅 · 白居易","name":"荅微之夸越州州宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贺上人回得报书，大夸州宅似仙居。\n厌看冯翊风沙久，喜见兰亭烟景初。\n日出旌旗生气色，月明楼阁在空虚。\n知君暗数江南郡，除却余杭尽不如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23438.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23438","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}